---

import {Image} from 'astro:assets';

import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

import FPMHero from '../../../public/images/Screenshot20250122-10513200000.png';

---

<Layout title="SpaceGameDev / Factory Props">

	<div class="ml-auto mr-auto w-[80%]">

		<div class="2xl:h-[550px] lg:h-[1024px]">

			<Image
					src={FPMHero}
					alt="Factory Props"
					width="900"
					height="500"
					class="rounded-2xl aspect-video lg:ml-auto lg:mr-0 shadow-[0px_0px_100px_-15px_#66a2a1] 2xl:hidden -mt-[150px]"
					id="mobile-header-image"
					loading="eager"
			/>

			<div id="fpm-heading" class="leading-3 lg:w-[60%] lg:float-left lg:absolute">

				<h1 class="font-heading font-bold text-white lg:text-8xl text-5xl">Factory Props</h1><br/>
				<h2 class="font-heading text-white  text-4xl"> Your Ultimate Decorating Toolkit.</h2><br/>
				<p class="text-white text-2xl bg-[#101014] bg-opacity-25 rounded-2xl md:w-[60%]">
					Factory Props is a mod for Satisfactory created to give you all the options in the world (literally) when decorating your factories!
				</p>

				<br/><br/>

				<div class="text-white p-3 rounded-lg bg-green-500 font-bold hover:bg-green-300 duration-300 box-border hover:ring-4 hover:text-black w-fit select-none">
					✓ Multiplayer Compatible
				</div>

				<br/><br/>

			</div>

			<script>

				import { animate, scroll } from "motion"

				animate("#fpm-heading", { y: [400, 100], opacity: [0, 100] }, { ease: "easeInOut", duration: 1} )

				animate("#mobile-header-image", { y: [400, 150], opacity: [0, 100] }, { ease: "easeInOut", duration: 1} )

			</script>

			<Image
					src={FPMHero}
					alt="Factory Props"
					width="900"
					height="500"
					loading="eager"
					class="rounded-2xl aspect-video lg:ml-auto lg:mr-0 shadow-[0px_0px_100px_-15px_#66a2a1] lg:w-[900px] w-[500px] 2xl:block hidden"
			/>

		</div>

		<br/><br/><br/><br/>

		<div class="border-[1px] border-opacity-10 rounded-2xl border-white bg-[#222225] box-border p-5">
			<div>
				<h1 class="text-white lg:text-5xl text-3xl font-heading font-bold">About the mod</h1><br/>
				<p class="text-white">
					Factory Props is your go-to mod for decorating your factories!
					With everything from parts, to plants, to anything in-between, Factory Props is extremely versatile.
					It allows you to do everything from making your factory look more lively, to letting you build your own biomes if you wanted to!
					<br/><br/>
					All of this content is unlocked in the HUB at Tier 1, and is available in the Build Menu across 3 categories: Factory Props, Factory Foliage, and Factory Decor.
					They are where you can find all of the buildables added with this mod.
					<br/><br/>
					<b>Categories:</b>

					<br/><br/>

					<b>Factory Props:</b> All of the parts and resources in the game as placeable objects.
					<br/><br/>
					<b>Factory Foliage:</b> All of the Plants, Rocks, and Coral you can find in the game.
					<br/><br/>
					<b>Factory Decor:</b> An assortment of other useful objects.
					<br/><br/>
					If there's a plant, rock or other object in the game that you can't find in Factory Props, please let me know! I'd be happy to add it.
					<br/><br/>

					In total, there are nearly 800 new buildables added with this mod!
					It's even better when paired with the Micro Manage mod to allow you to place objects in any orientation you like and manipulate them more than you can with just Factory Props.
					Note: Micro Manage is not currently available for Satisfactory 1.0, so I recommend that you try Infinite Nudge instead.
					<br/><br/>
					The mod is updated regularly with new content and bug fixes.
					If you'd like more info about what I'm working on, follow me on X: <a href="https://x.com/SpaceGameDev568" class="text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-300 duration-300 hover:ring-4 rounded-2xl">@SpaceGameDev568</a>
					<br/><br/>

					I hope you enjoy this
					If you encounter a bug while using the mod please open an issue ticket on the GitHub page, or ping me on the Satisfactory Modding Discord: <b class="font-mono font-bold  bg-gray-900 p-1 rounded-2xl">@spacegamedev</b>.

					<br/><br/>

				</p>
			</div>

		</div>

	</div>

</Layout>